Requirements
============

To compile PokerTH you need:

- Qt version >= 6.7.0, 6.9.2 LTS recommended  --> https://www.qt.io/
- Boost (thread, filesystem, datetime, program_options, iostreams, asio, regex, random, uuid; version >= 1.83)  --> https://www.boost.org/
- protoc >= 2.3.0 (during build), libprotobuf >= 2.3.0  --> https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf
- OpenSSL

Build and install
=================

The recommended way to build is via the top-level Makefile. See docs/building.md for the full guide.

Quick start:

  Linux (native):    make setup-linux && make linux
  Windows (cross):   make setup-windows && make windows
  macOS:             make setup-macos && make macos

Run `make` or `make help` for all targets (setup, build, installers, clean).

Manual / legacy
---------------

  Linux:   See docs/building.md (or use: ./scripts/setup.sh then ./scripts/build.sh)
  Windows: See docker/windows/
  Android: See docker/android/
  macOS:   See docs/building.md (or use: ./scripts/setup_macos.sh then ./scripts/build_macos.sh)
